the Ellen MacArthur Foundation,

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.930
and Alonso Ortiz Galán,
community engagement manager

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:22.472
at the Global Partnership for
Sustainable Development Data.

00:08:22.472 --> 00:08:24.892
