00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:59.250
can be a little bit esoteric,
and, at least in my experience,

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.480
a little Eurocentric.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:03.840
So seeing that there is
some take-up, obviously

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:06.800
in Europe, but here in the
US, and then in Africa,

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.860
